PLACEHOLDER-DO-NOT-USE
# This file documents where the Cloudflare Tunnel token lives (compose.tunnel.yaml,
# TUNNEL_TOKEN_FILE). Do not use this value and do not copy this file to
# tunnel_token.txt. Obtain a real token from the Cloudflare Zero Trust dashboard
# (Networks > Tunnels > <your tunnel> > Configure > "Docker" install command —
# copy just the token argument) and write it with no trailing newline:
#   printf '%s' '<token-from-dashboard>' > secrets/tunnel_token.txt
#   chmod 600 secrets/tunnel_token.txt
# Rotation: revoke/reissue the token from the same dashboard page, repeat the
# steps above, then restart the cloudflared service.
